      <trans-unit id="seasons.winter.description" datatype="html">
        <source>De décembre à avril, la station vit au rythme de la neige, loin de l&apos;agitation des grandes stations.</source>
        <target>From December to April, the resort lives to the rhythm of the snow, far from the bustle of the big resorts.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="seasons.winter.alt" datatype="html">
        <source>Le front de neige du Sauze, au pied des chalets, face aux sommets enneigés</source>
        <target>The snow front at Le Sauze, at the foot of the chalets, facing the snowy peaks</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="seasons.winter.skiArea.title" datatype="html">
        <source>Le domaine Sauze – Super-Sauze</source>
        <target>The Sauze – Super-Sauze ski area</target>
